ate machine."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"initialState","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initial state for the state machine."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"logCapacity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Max capacity of transition log. Set to nil for unlimited"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"number of entries in the transition log. The entries keep the events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with what they carry, so an unlimited log is not for events carrying much."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The transitions have to define a consistent state machine, where an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event processed at a state leads to one single state. Several events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can lead from a state to the same state, and the same event can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used from several states."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any initial state is accepted, also a state without transitions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leading from it. Such a state machine is at an ending state from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the start, and rejects every event."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The transitions are written in event triggers, which does not tell the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type of the events, so it has to be written: "},{"code":"StateMachine<LoadEvent, LoadState>(transitions:initialState:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". It is known from the transitions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only for events being their own trigger."}]},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"DefinitionError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the transitions in conflict, if two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or more transitions lead from the same state, for the same event,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to different states."}]}]}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/init(transitions:initialstate:logcapacity:)-1ngnd"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/init(transitions:initialState:logCapacity:)-1ngnd","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"init","modules":[{"name":"MiamiStateMachine"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"convenience"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"transitions"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine14TransitionRuleV","text":"TransitionRule"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C5Eventxmfp","text":"Event"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC5EventP0D7TriggerQa","text":"EventTrigger"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B0q_mfp","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":">>, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"initialState"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B0q_mfp","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"logCapacity"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifi